. Elegant 3 & 4-bedroom townhouses with modern amenities, easy access to major landmarks, and flexible payment plans.\n"},"more_info":[{"id":5381,"answer":"<p>Greenspoint at Emaar South offers a selection of 3 and 4-bedroom townhouses.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What types of properties are available at Greenspoint at Emaar South?  "},{"id":5382,"answer":"<p>The payment plan for Greenspoint at Emaar South is structured as an 80/20 plan, where 80% of the payment is made during construction and the remaining 20% is due upon handover, scheduled for 2029. This flexible plan makes it an affordable option for potential homeowners and investors.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What are the payment plans available for Greenspoint at Emaar South?  "},{"id":5383,"answer":"<p>Greenspoint offers a wide range of amenities, including an 18-hole golf course, swimming pools for both adults and children, a jogging track, sports courts, a multi-purpose room, a nursery, and a neighborhood park. These facilities promote an active and healthy lifestyle for all residents.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities are available at Greenspoint at Emaar South? "},{"id":5384,"answer":"<p>Due to its prime location in Dubai South, near key landmarks like Expo City Dubai and Al Maktoum International Airport, Greenspoint at Emaar South offers high rental potential and long-term capital appreciation. As the community continues to develop, it presents an excellent investment opportunity with a growing demand for residential properties.</p>","question":"What is the expected return on investment for Greenspoint at Emaar South?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":[],"future_launch":null,"adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"i/Greenspoint_at_Emaar_South_Dubai_by_Emaar_Properties_aeef84ec0c.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Greenspoint_at_Emaar_South_Dubai_by_Emaar_Properties_aeef84ec0c.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/420x/Gre